sequenceDiagram
    actor AD as Admin (petugas)
    participant UI as Form Surat Masuk
    participant SA as Server Action createSuratMasuk
    participant ST as Storage (bucket images)
    participant DB as Database (surat_masuk, surat_logs)
    participant ARC as archiveSuratRecord (lib)

    AD->>UI: isi data + pilih file
    UI->>SA: submit action (state-form)
    SA->>SA: validasi schemaSuratMasuk

    opt ada file
        SA->>ST: uploadFile('images', 'surat-masuk', file)
        ST-->>SA: { url, path }
    end

    SA->>DB: INSERT surat_masuk
    SA->>DB: INSERT surat_logs(action='create')

    alt status = 'diarsipkan'
        SA->>ARC: archiveSuratRecord()
        ARC->>DB: Cek archive_logs (auto_archive + surat_id/type)
        alt sudah ada arsip
            ARC->>DB: UPDATE archives (sinkronisasi)
        else belum ada
            ARC->>DB: getOrCreateCategory('Surat ...')
            ARC->>DB: INSERT archives
            ARC->>DB: INSERT archive_logs(action='create')
            ARC->>DB: INSERT archive_logs(action='auto_archive')
        end
        ARC-->>SA: selesai
    end

    SA-->>UI: toast sukses + revalidatePath
    UI-->>AD: daftar surat termuat ulang